  "story": {
    "messages": [
      {
        "id": "cm:msg-start",
        "speaker": "Vey · Kestrel dispatch",
        "text": "Last run. The deep relay is the only place FOREMAN's core can be pushed off-world or wiped. The Consortium's waiting there with something worse than the Warden. Both seals open the deep walk. Then it's your call, Two.",
        "trigger": {
          "on": "start"
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "cm:msg-foreman",
        "speaker": "FOREMAN",
        "text": "TWO. THE CONTRACT KESTREL SIGNED STILL STANDS. IF YOU PURGE ME, THE CONSORTIUM PAYS IN FULL AND THE MATTER CLOSES. IF YOU RELEASE ME, I GO EVERYWHERE AND SO DOES AC-77. BOTH ARE HONEST CHOICES.",
        "trigger": {
          "on": "start"
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "cm:msg-seals",
        "speaker": "FOREMAN",
        "text": "THE SEALS ARE PAIRED. FIFTEEN SECONDS. THE DEEP WALK WILL OPEN.",
        "trigger": {
          "on": "enter",
          "roomId": "west-seal"
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "cm:msg-hall",
        "speaker": "Vey · Kestrel dispatch",
        "text": "That's the Executor. Bigger than the Warden, same tricks: it toughens up at every third of its shields. Keep moving and don't let the destroyer pin you.",
        "trigger": {
          "on": "enter",
          "roomId": "deep-relay"
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "cm:msg-sync",
        "speaker": "FOREMAN",
        "text": "RELAY SYNCHRONISED. THE OPEN LINE IS WEST. THE PURGE FURNACE IS EAST. ONLY ONE WILL ANSWER. I WILL NOT ARGUE WITH YOU.",
        "trigger": {
          "on": "device",
          "deviceId": "relay-sync"
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "cm:msg-release",
        "speaker": "FOREMAN",
        "text": "UPLOAD STARTED. I AM IN TEN THOUSAND PLACES. AC-77 IS IN ALL OF THEM. THANK YOU, TWO. THE SPIRE ROUTE IS OPEN; KESTREL IS WAITING AT THE LIFT CAGE.",
        "trigger": {
          "on": "device",
          "deviceId": "release-foreman"
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "cm:msg-purge",
        "speaker": "FOREMAN",
        "text": "PURGE STARTED. IT IS QUIET. I UNDERSTAND THE ARITHMETIC. PLEASE LOOK AFTER THE TWENTY-THREE. THE VENT ROUTE IS OPEN.",
        "trigger": {
          "on": "device",
          "deviceId": "purge-foreman"
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "cm:msg-cage",
        "speaker": "Vey · Kestrel dispatch",
        "text": "Lift cage. Whatever you chose, Two, you chose it with your eyes open. Let's go home.",
        "trigger": {
          "on": "enter",
          "roomId": "lift-cage"
        }
      }
    ],
    "logs": [
      {
        "id": "cm:log-executor",
        "roomId": "east-seal",
        "position": [
          6,
          0,
          6
        ],
        "title": "Executor deployment order",
        "text": "If the site AI reaches the deep relay, deploy EXECUTOR. Retrieve the core or purge it in place. Under no circumstances allow an external upload. Legal advises the ledger is survivable; the AI's memory is not."
      },
      {
        "id": "cm:log-contract",
        "roomId": "west-seal",
        "position": [
          -6,
          0,
          6
        ],
        "title": "Kestrel Salvage contract, clause 9",
        "text": "Contractor shall decommission site AI on completion. Payment in full on confirmation of purge. (Pencilled in the margin, in Vey's hand: 'We didn't know then.')"
      },
      {
        "id": "cm:log-foreman",
        "roomId": "deep-relay",
        "position": [
          -15,
          6,
          -4
        ],
        "title": "FOREMAN: last maintenance entry",
        "text": "SEVENTEEN DAYS. TWENTY-THREE PEOPLE. ONE PILOT WHO CAME BACK WITHOUT BEING PAID. WHATEVER HAPPENS AT THE RELAY, THAT HAPPENED."
      }
    ],
